<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/34/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue is authorised of a sum not exceeding one billion five hundred and seventy-one million nine hundred and eighty-four thousand one hundred and fifty-five ringgit (RM1,571,984,155) from the Consolidated Fund for expenditure on the services specified in the Schedule for the service of the year 1996, not provided for or not fully provided for by the Supply Act 1996 and the Supplementary Supply (1996) Act 1996."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/34/eng@> .
